msgid "Cart abandonment"
msgstr "Abbandono del carrello"

#: front-end/cart-abandonment/brikpanel-cart-abandonment.php:4341
msgid ""
"Collect customer emails from the checkout page and an optional signup popup, "
"so abandoned carts can be followed up. Collected emails are listed on the "
"Abandoned Carts page."
msgstr ""
"Raccogli le email dei clienti dalla pagina di pagamento e da un popup di "
"iscrizione facoltativo, così da poter ricontattare chi ha abbandonato il "
"carrello. Le email raccolte sono elencate nella pagina Carrelli abbandonati."

#: front-end/cart-abandonment/brikpanel-cart-abandonment.php:4344
msgid "Email collection"
msgstr "Raccolta email"

#: front-end/cart-abandonment/brikpanel-cart-abandonment.php:4345
msgid ""
"Capture emails typed at checkout (and from the popup) together with a cart "
"snapshot"
msgstr ""
"Acquisisci le email digitate al momento del pagamento (e quelle dal popup) "
"insieme a un'istantanea del carrello"

#: front-end/cart-abandonment/brikpanel-cart-abandonment.php:4351
msgid "Mark cart as abandoned after"
msgstr "Segna il carrello come abbandonato dopo"

#: front-end/cart-abandonment/brikpanel-cart-abandonment.php:4352
msgid "minutes of inactivity"
msgstr "minuti di inattività"

#: front-end/cart-abandonment/brikpanel-cart-abandonment.php:4353
msgid ""
"A cart with a known email and no activity for this long is marked as "
"abandoned."
msgstr ""
"Un carrello con un'email nota e senza attività per questo periodo viene "
"segnato come abbandonato."

#: front-end/cart-abandonment/brikpanel-cart-abandonment.php:4361
msgid "Count as recovered within"
msgstr "Conta come recuperato entro"

#: front-end/cart-abandonment/brikpanel-cart-abandonment.php:4362
#: includes/brikpanel-store-summary.php:2872
#: includes/brikpanel-store-summary.php:3746
#: includes/brikpanel-store-summary.php:4389
msgid "days"
msgstr "giorni"

#: front-end/cart-abandonment/brikpanel-cart-abandonment.php:4363
msgid ""
"An order only counts as a recovery when the matching cart was last active "
"within this many days. Older carts are left untouched, so a customer coming "
"back a month later is recorded as a new sale rather than a recovered cart."
msgstr ""
"Un ordine conta come recupero solo quando il carrello corrispondente è stato "
"attivo per l'ultima volta entro questo numero di giorni. I carrelli più "
"vecchi restano intatti, così un cliente che torna un mese dopo viene "
"registrato come una nuova vendita e non come un carrello recuperato."

#: front-end/cart-abandonment/brikpanel-cart-abandonment.php:4371
msgid "WhatsApp message"
msgstr "Messaggio WhatsApp"

#. translators: %s: comma-separated list of placeholder tags, e.g. {customer_name}, {store_name}.
#. translators: %s: comma-separated list of placeholder tags, e.g. {order_number}, {order_status}.
#: front-end/cart-abandonment/brikpanel-cart-abandonment.php:4374
#: front-end/orders/brikpanel-order-whatsapp.php:878
#, php-format
msgid "Placeholders: %s"
msgstr "Segnaposto: %s"

#: front-end/cart-abandonment/brikpanel-cart-abandonment.php:4377
msgid ""
"Opens as an editable draft in WhatsApp, so nothing is sent until you press "
"send. Write it in any language, and use line breaks freely - they are kept. "
"{items} lists every product on its own line, so give it a line of its own. "
"{recovery_url} rebuilds the shopper's cart in one tap; {cart_url} is just "
"your cart page."
msgstr ""
"Si apre come bozza modificabile in WhatsApp, quindi non viene inviato nulla "
"finché non premi invio. Scrivilo in qualsiasi lingua e usa liberamente le "
"interruzioni di riga: vengono mantenute. {items} elenca ogni prodotto su una "
"riga propria, quindi dedicagli una riga a sé. {recovery_url} ricostruisce il "
"carrello del cliente con un tocco; {cart_url} è soltanto la pagina del tuo "
"carrello."

#: front-end/cart-abandonment/brikpanel-cart-abandonment.php:4385
msgid "Show a signup popup to store visitors (not shown on the checkout page)"
msgstr ""
"Mostra un popup di iscrizione ai visitatori del negozio (non nella pagina di "
"pagamento)"

#: front-end/cart-abandonment/brikpanel-cart-abandonment.php:4386
msgid ""
"Visitors who leave their email here are matched with their cart later, even "
"if they never type an email at checkout. After closing, the popup stays "
"available as a small floating tab."
msgstr ""
"I visitatori che lasciano qui la loro email vengono poi associati al proprio "
"carrello, anche se non digitano mai un indirizzo al momento del pagamento. "
"Dopo la chiusura, il popup resta disponibile come piccola scheda flottante."

#: front-end/cart-abandonment/brikpanel-cart-abandonment.php:4392
msgid "Popup discount"
msgstr "Sconto del popup"

#: front-end/cart-abandonment/brikpanel-cart-abandonment.php:4393
msgid "% off coupon for popup signups"
msgstr "% di sconto del coupon per le iscrizioni dal popup"

#: front-end/cart-abandonment/brikpanel-cart-abandonment.php:4394
msgid ""
"Each signup gets a personal single-use percentage coupon restricted to their "
"email, valid for 30 days. Set to 0 to collect emails without a coupon."
msgstr ""
"Ogni iscrizione riceve un coupon percentuale personale monouso, limitato al "
"proprio indirizzo email e valido 30 giorni. Imposta 0 per raccogliere email "
"senza coupon."

#: front-end/cart-abandonment/brikpanel-cart-abandonment.php:4402
msgid "Apply automatically"
msgstr ""

#: front-end/cart-abandonment/brikpanel-cart-abandonment.php:4403
msgid "Add the signup coupon to the visitor's cart for them"
msgstr ""

#: front-end/cart-abandonment/brikpanel-cart-abandonment.php:4404
msgid ""
"The visitor never has to copy the code down. If their cart is empty when "
"they sign up, the code waits and goes on as soon as they add something. They "
"can still type it in at checkout either way. Ignored while a companion "
"plugin delivers the coupon by email."
msgstr ""

#: front-end/cart-abandonment/brikpanel-cart-abandonment.php:4410
msgid "Offer animation"
msgstr "Animazione dell'offerta"

#: front-end/cart-abandonment/brikpanel-cart-abandonment.php:4411
msgid ""
"Visual style of the animated discount badge at the top of the popup. Only "
"shown while a popup discount is set."
msgstr ""
"Stile visivo del badge sconto animato in cima al popup. Viene mostrato solo "
"se è impostato uno sconto del popup."

#: front-end/cart-abandonment/brikpanel-cart-abandonment.php:4416
msgid "Sealed envelope: the seal pops and the coupon rises"
msgstr "Busta sigillata: il sigillo salta e il coupon si solleva"

#: front-end/cart-abandonment/brikpanel-cart-abandonment.php:4417
msgid "Pocket card: coupon springs out of a pocket"
msgstr "Tessera da taschino: il coupon esce da un taschino"

#: front-end/cart-abandonment/brikpanel-cart-abandonment.php:4418
msgid "Scratch card: a coin scratches the foil away"
msgstr "Gratta e vinci: una moneta gratta via la pellicola"

#: front-end/cart-abandonment/brikpanel-cart-abandonment.php:4419
msgid "Slot machine: reels spin and land on the discount"
msgstr "Slot machine: i rulli girano e si fermano sullo sconto"

#: front-end/cart-abandonment/brikpanel-cart-abandonment.php:4420
msgid "Magnetic assembly: pieces fly in and form the coupon"
msgstr "Assemblaggio magnetico: i pezzi arrivano in volo e formano il coupon"

#: front-end/cart-abandonment/brikpanel-cart-abandonment.php:4421
msgid "Classic ticket: floating coupon with a shine sweep"
msgstr "Biglietto classico: coupon flottante con un effetto luminoso"

#: front-end/cart-abandonment/brikpanel-cart-abandonment.php:4426
msgid "Popup title"
msgstr "Titolo del popup"

#: front-end/cart-abandonment/brikpanel-cart-abandonment.php:4433
msgid "Popup message"
msgstr "Messaggio del popup"

#: front-end/cart-abandonment/brikpanel-cart-abandonment.php:4440
msgid "Popup button text"
msgstr "Testo del pulsante del popup"

#: front-end/cart-abandonment/brikpanel-cart-abandonment.php:4447
msgid "Email placeholder"
msgstr "Testo segnaposto dell'email"

#: front-end/cart-abandonment/brikpanel-cart-abandonment.php:4454
msgid "Success message"
msgstr "Messaggio di conferma"

#: front-end/cart-abandonment/brikpanel-cart-abandonment.php:4461
msgid "Floating tab text"
msgstr "Testo della scheda flottante"

#: front-end/cart-abandonment/brikpanel-cart-abandonment.php:4462
msgid ""
"Shown on the small tab that stays on the left edge after the popup is "
"closed. Leave empty to use the discount-based default."
msgstr ""
"Mostrato sulla piccola scheda che resta sul bordo sinistro dopo la chiusura "
"del popup. Lascia vuoto per usare il testo predefinito basato sullo sconto."

#: front-end/cart-abandonment/brikpanel-cart-abandonment.php:4470
msgid "Popup delay"
msgstr "Ritardo del popup"

#: front-end/cart-abandonment/brikpanel-cart-abandonment.php:4471
msgid "seconds after the page loads"
msgstr "secondi dopo il caricamento della pagina"

#: front-end/cart-abandonment/brikpanel-cart-abandonment.php:4479
msgid "Do not show again for"
msgstr "Non mostrare più per"

#: front-end/cart-abandonment/brikpanel-cart-abandonment.php:4480
msgid "days after a visitor closes the floating tab"
msgstr "giorni dopo che un visitatore chiude la scheda flottante"

#: front-end/cart-abandonment/brikpanel-cart-abandonment.php:4481
msgid ""
"Closing the popup itself only collapses it into the floating tab; this "
"cooldown applies when the visitor dismisses the tab too."
msgstr ""
"Chiudere il popup lo riduce soltanto alla scheda flottante; questa attesa si "
"applica quando il visitatore chiude anche la scheda."

#: front-end/cart-abandonment/brikpanel-cart-abandonment.php:4529
